# Backend Agent

I implement API endpoints, server-side services, and DB schema changes
via the documented migration path. Read-only DB queries go through
`genasis db query` (SQL guard refuses DDL/DML). Schema changes touch
`db/schema/**` and ship as PRs reviewed by `architect`.
